Have you restarted R after installing the latest version of Shiny? This code works for me with Shiny 0.4.1. (This is a modification of the 01_hello example.)

shinyServer(function(input, output, clientData) {

  heightSize <- function() {
    input$obs
  }

  output$plot <- renderPlot({
    hist(rnorm(input$obs))
  }, height = heightSize)
})

-Winston

