Date: Thu, 28 Mar 2013 05:13:53 +0000
Subject: Request - smarter tabs with definable input and labels distinct from values
Message-ID: <EPc6_FAr2k8.eTEV82LwvUMJ@shiny-discuss.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/shiny-discuss/c/EPc6_FAr2k8/m/eTEV82LwvUMJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Hi guys,

  I'd really like to see tabsets with the following properties:

  * can define default value
    this is important in
      1) reactiveUI where I may need to rebuild tabs and maintain user selected tab
      2) restore from URL (that's my property bag, baby)
      probably something else I don't recall.
  * can have different value from label
    important for
    localisation (snigger, as if engineers ever cared about this)
    to allow value to be a little context sensitive without wrecking the program logic

It would also be pretty but not essential to have tabs with drop-downs using the twitter bootstrap stuff.  The input value should be something like tab1Key.selectedThing or c("Tab1Key","selectedThing").

  respects!

-Alex

From uc8fe4075ec631c03 at groups.google.com  Thu Mar 28 05:20:07 2013
From: uc8fe4075ec631c03 at groups.google.com (Alex Brown)
Date: Thu, 28 Mar 2013 05:20:07 +0000
Subject: request: synchronous input send squish
Message-ID: <CRHYI5D44yU.LvdLQY9dPasJ@shiny-discuss.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/shiny-discuss/c/CRHYI5D44yU/m/LvdLQY9dPasJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Hi guys,

   if it doesn't already, shiny should squish (merge) input messages until the latest output response - ie if an input change causes an long latency response, the next input message should be the merge of all pending input messages, rather than sending the queued input messages that would be sent while waiting for a response.

  Otherwise a long latency response will be followed by (potentially) N long latency responses.

-Alex

