I have a data frame full of names of different species and it's saved in back-end of the server. In the UI part I have a textInput window. So the idea is i enter a string to the textInput, the server-side performs grep on all species, finding the one i need and then performs calculation. However the problem is, that when I enter the first letter it retrieves the first field which contains that letter  (in alphabetical order) and triggers the calculations. What i want to do, is to delay the update time of reactive component such as text field or slider, so that user could have at least one second before triggering the search and calculations based on that search.

